<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">此刻 · 体验设置</view><view class="title">按你的习惯。</view><view class="subtitle">声音、触感和画面，由你决定。</view>
<button wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-panel" bindtap="refresh">{{error}}<text class="error-action">重新加载 →</text></button>
<view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="loading-state"><view class="loading-dot"></view><text>正在读取设置…</text></view>
<view wx:else class="settings-card">
<view class="setting-row row"><view class="setting-copy"><view>操作音效</view><view class="muted">打火、抖灰和结束时播放声音</view></view><switch color="#344f41" checked="{{sound}}" data-key="sound" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="change" aria-label="操作音效"/></view>
<view class="setting-row row"><view class="setting-copy"><view>轻微震动</view><view class="muted">操作时给指尖一点反馈</view></view><switch color="#344f41" checked="{{vibration}}" data-key="vibration" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="change" aria-label="轻微震动"/></view>
<picker range="{{qualities}}" value="{{qualityIndex}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchange="quality" aria-label="画面偏好，{{qualities[qualityIndex]}}"><view class="setting-row quality-row row"><view class="setting-copy"><view>画面偏好</view><view class="muted">流畅模式减少烟雾与绘制频率</view></view><text class="quality">{{qualities[qualityIndex]}} ›</text></view></picker>
</view><view class="about"><view class="eyebrow">MOMENT / 此刻</view><view class="muted">给平常的日子，留一个短暂的停顿。</view><view class="footnote">虚拟互动体验 · 不涉及真实商品交易</view></view></view>
